ls to brokers that we are selling dollars to the market."\par \par \uc2 Mexico is committed to a freely-floating exchange rate and usually refrains from opting for more direct forms of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  used by other emerging market economies. \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-2-17T18:01:46.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160217ec2h01ney\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
