\par\par \b \uc2 Mexican Peso's Fall Prompts  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 280 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 2015\par 20:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY\u8212\'20\'14The \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $200 million at an auction on Thursday as the peso sank to a low against the dollar after a report that showed U.S. economic growth accelerated in the second quarter kept open the possibility of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  raising interest rates in September.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  placed the $200 million at an average exchange rate of 16.4622 pesos to the dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  marked the third time since December that the \uc2 Bank of Mexico\uc2  has sold dollars through auctions triggered when the peso is 1.5% weaker than the previous day's fixing.\par \par \uc2 Demand at the auction was $453 million, with bids ranging from 16.4573 pesos to 16.4670 pesos per dollar. The peso remained stable following the auction, quoted in Mexico City at 16.4680 to the dollar, according to Infosel.\par \par \uc2 In addition to the conditional auctions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since March has been selling $52 million a day from reserves to supply liquidity to the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The peso weakened sharply after the report that U.S. gross domestic product expanded 2.3% in the second quarter, which was below expectations but confirmed a rebound in the economy after a revised 0.6% growth in the first quarter.\par \par \uc2 "The GDP numbers are consistent with a sustained recovery in the U.S. at the time when a first interest-rate increase by the Fed is considered to be imminent," Banco Base said in a note.\par \par \uc2 Write to Anthony Harrup at anthony.harrup@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 July 30, 2015 14:35 ET (18:35 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150730eb7u003nd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
