\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Mexican Peso, Korean Won Rally Further\b0\par\par\uc2 By Prabha Natarajan   \par \uc2 500 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2013\par 21:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso and the South Korean won led the continued rally in emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday though the pace was much more muted.\par \par \uc2 The dollar hit a 20-month low to the peso, stirring some concerns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be contemplating ways to decelerate the gains.\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso's March rally ramped up even more after the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  last week announced further monetary easing to stimulate its economy. Since then, higher-yielding assets, including emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , have seen sharp gains.\par \par \uc2 The dollar dropped to a fresh low of MXN12.0372, down 0.54% on the day, on the back of fresh inflows from investment managers and speculative money accounts. Analysts say that the peso has appreciated strongly not only versus the dollar but also against other majors like the yen and the euro.\par \par \uc2 This, they say, strengthens the argument for an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or at least a counter measure from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that could slow the pace of appreciation.\par \par \uc2 "We may be days or weeks from an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  announcement in \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Benito Berber,\par \par \uc2 This may not be unusual, given other central banks such as Turkey and Chile had indicated that they would not be indifferent to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation. Mr. Berber expects the \uc2 Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to come up with a mechanism that would cushion the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's volatility.\par \par \uc2 It is unclear what the trigger would be for such a move. One possibility could be when the dollar dips below MXN12.\par \par \uc2 South Korea's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised market participants by keeping its policy rates unchanged. But analysts expect the bank to ease in the coming months after it potentially revises its economic forecast lower.\par \par \uc2 The Korean won, however, got a lift after the unexpected move. The dollar fell to KRW1129.5, down 0.5% on the day.\par \par \uc2 In Brazil, expectations that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be forced to raise rates by at least 25 basis points at its rate-setting meeting next week, especially after comments by President Dilma Rousseff led to the rally in the real stalling. The dollar remained steady at BRL1.9736, according to CQG data\par \par \uc2 Market participants also expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act given Brazil's accelerating inflation.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, emerging-market issuers continued their hectic pace of debt offerings.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the Dominican Republic and Lebanon were in the market with benchmark-sized deals. The Dominican Republic was in the market with a $1 billion, 10-year bond that is also expected to be priced later in the day.\par \par \uc2 Sovereigns and companies have been in the market this week tapping investors renewed quest for higher-yielding emerging-market assets. Many of these dollar bonds sell at much lower yields than the cost to borrow in their own countries. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  --In-Soo Nam contributed to this article. \par  \par   Write to Prabha Natarajan at Prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 April 11, 2013 15:22 ET (19:22 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130411e94b00567\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
